  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 902.03 Status",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 902.03 “Status” means whether a water meets one or more of the categories listed in Env-Wr 903.01 and, if so, which one(s).\n\nSource. #8383, eff 6-22-05; ss by #10417, eff 9-24-13; ss by #13726, eff 8-19-23",
